 who's Yara?","fa":"و یارا کیست؟"},{"s":101.27,"e":102.91,"de":"Yara ist Nicos Tante.","en":"Yara is Nico's aunt.","fa":"یارا عمه‌ی نیکو است."},{"s":103.05,"e":104.71,"de":"Er hat gesagt, sie hat hier einen Fahrradladen.","en":"He said she had a bike shop here.","fa":"او گفته که او اینجا یک دوچرخه‌فروشی دارد."},{"s":104.73,"e":105.57,"de":"Aber er hat die Adresse nicht.","en":"But he doesn't have the address.","fa":"اما او آدرس را ندارد."},{"s":105.59,"e":107.86,"de":"Auch nicht so gut.","en":"Not so good either.","fa":"این هم زیاد خوب نیست."},{"s":109.36,"e":110.32,"de":"Und wie alt bist du?","en":"And how old are you?","fa":"و چند ساله‌ای؟"},{"s":110.84,"e":112.3,"de":"Ich bin 22 Jahre alt.","en":"I'm 22 years old.","fa":"من ۲۲ ساله‌ام."},{"s":112.32,"e":113.07,"de":"Und du?","en":"And you?","fa":"و تو؟"},{"s":113.63,"e":114.57,"de":"Kommst du aus Deutschland?","en":"Are you from Germany?","fa":"اهل آلمانی؟"},{"s":115.19,"e":117.45,"de":"Ich bin 25 Jahre.","en":"I'm 25 years old.","fa":"من ۲۵ ساله‌ام."},{"s":118.31,"e":119.71,"de":"Und ja, ich komme aus Deutschland.","en":"And yes, I'm from Germany.","fa":"و بله، اهل آلمانم."},{"s":120.87,"e":121.71,"de":"Und ich heiße Nina.","en":"And my name is Nina.","fa":"و اسم من نینا است."},{"s":122.21,"e":124.43,"de":"Ich komme auch aus Deutschland und bin 23 Jahre alt.","en":"I also come from Germany and am 23 years old.","fa":"من هم اهل آلمانم و ۲۳ ساله‌ام."},{"s":124.87,"e":125.62,"de":"Hi!","en":"Hi!","fa":"سلام."},{"s":127.04,"e":129.12,"de":"Kann Nico zwei Tage hier wohnen?","en":"Can Nico live here for two days?","fa":"نیکو می‌تواند دو روز اینجا بماند؟"},{"s":129.68,"e":130.26,"de":"Klar.","en":"Sure.","fa":"معلوم است."},{"s":130.42,"e":131.17,"de":"Kein Problem!","en":"No problem!","fa":"مشکلی نیست!"},{"s":131.4,"e":132.8,"de":"Willkommen in der Wagnergasse!","en":"Welcome to Wagnergasse!","fa":"به واگنرگاسه خوش آمدی!"},{"s":133.0,"e":133.56,"de":"Danke schön!","en":"Thank you.","fa":"خیلی ممنون!"},{"s":133.58,"e":1