, I'll do it.","fa":"آه، صبر کن، من انجامش می‌دهم."},{"s":217.5,"e":218.34,"de":"Was ist mit dir, Nico?","en":"What about you, Nico?","fa":"تو چه می‌خوری نیکو؟"},{"s":218.34,"e":219.04,"de":"Hast du auch Durst?","en":"Are you thirsty?","fa":"تو هم تشنه‌ای؟"},{"s":221.56,"e":222.5,"de":"Was möchtest du trinken?","en":"What do you want to drink?","fa":"چه می‌خواهی بنوشی؟"},{"s":223.04,"e":223.76,"de":"Cola bitte.","en":"Coke, please.","fa":"کولا لطفاً."},{"s":225.06,"e":225.74,"de":"Alles klar.","en":"All right.","fa":"باشد."},{"s":225.94,"e":226.9,"de":"Dann nehme ich Limonade.","en":"Then I'll take lemonade.","fa":"پس من لیموناد می‌گیرم."},{"s":227.36,"e":228.38,"de":"Also, Freunde, ich hab 'ne Idee!","en":"So, friends, I have an idea!","fa":"خب بچه‌ها، من یک ایده دارم!"},{"s":228.48,"e":229.23,"de":"Wir …","en":"We...","fa":"ما …"},{"s":229.31,"e":235.24,"de":"wir posten das Foto von Yara bei Book und fragen: Wer kennt","en":"we post the photo of Yara at Book and ask: Who knows","fa":"عکس یارا را در «بوک» می‌گذاریم و می‌پرسیم: چه کسی این"},{"s":235.26,"e":236.38,"de":"diesen Fahrradladen?","en":"This bike shop?","fa":"دوچرخه‌فروشی را می‌شناسد؟"},{"s":236.68,"e":238.34,"de":"Und so finden wir die Adresse raus.","en":"And that's how we find out the address.","fa":"و این‌طوری آدرس را پیدا می‌کنیم."},{"s":238.34,"e":239.09,"de":"Ja, vielleicht.","en":"Yeah, maybe.","fa":"بله، شاید."},{"s":242.61,"e":243.47,"de":"Habt ihr Hunger?","en":"Are you hungry?","fa":"گرسنه‌اید؟"},{"s":245.34,"e":245.79,"de":"Hunger?","en":"Hunger?","fa":"گرسنگی؟"},{"s":245.64,"e":246.39,"de":"Hungry?","en":"Hungry?","fa":"گرسنه؟"},{"s":248.0,"e":248.64,"de":"Ja!","en":"Yes!","fa":"بله!"},{"s":253.84,"e":254.29,"de":"Hier.","en":"Here.","fa":"بفرمایید."},{"s":254.0,"e":255.16,"de":"Hier sind die Speisekarten!","en":"Here are the menus!","fa":"این هم منوها!"},{"s":259.7,"e":262.47,"de":"So, also dann prost!","en":"All right, then, cheer up!","fa":"خب، پس به سلامتی!"},{"s":263.17,"e":263.92,"de":"